    "titleEn": "The Switchback Belt · Urban Design for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "以京张铁路“人”字形折返线为原型，提出“京张折返带（The Switchback Belt）”总体概念：一条 9.72 公里的折返脊公共空间主脊，锚定上行（众智园）、原点（AI原点社区）、回响（大钟寺）三处重点区域，由编组翼与试车翼完成要素调度与场景验证。方案给出完整命名与视觉识别方向、6 个国际生态案例、12 张 AI 场景卡（含 3 个产业测试验证场景）、6 类用户画像、4 处 AI 朝圣地标、5 项年度活动机制与 18 个更新项目，并以 48 个无缝隙无重叠的用地分区、9 个 GeoJSON 图层与 EPSG:4548 面积复算作为可核验证据。全部空间建议均为概念建议，不替代法定规划。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the 人-shaped switchback of the Jing-Zhang Railway as its prototype, this proposal puts forward The Switchback Belt: a 9.72 km public-space spine anchoring three key areas — Ascent (Zhongzhiyuan), Origin (AI Origin Community) and Echo (Dazhongsi) — served by a Marshalling Wing and a Test-Track Wing. It provides a complete naming and visual identity direction, six international ecosystem cases, twelve AI scenario cards (three of them industry test beds), six personas, four AI pilgrimage landmarks, five annual operating mechanisms and eighteen renewal projects, all evidenced by a 48-polygon gap-free land-use partition, nine GeoJSON layers and area recomputation in EPSG:4548. Every spatial move is a conceptual suggestion and does not replace statutory planning.",
