    "titleEn": "JINGZHANG SWITCH — Let Humans Decide the Track of a Centennial AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "以1909年詹天佑青龙桥人字形折返线的道岔智慧为历史原点，把AI创新带设计为一套由人类在关键节点决定方向的轨道系统：一轨（京张遗址公园慢行绿脊）三岔（众智园研发道岔·绿、原点社区人才道岔·黄、大钟寺市场道岔·红）两翼（中关村科技服务翼、小月河场景赋能翼），用绿/黄/红三态道岔语言把AI城市的方向选择权交还人类。",
    "summaryEn": "Rooted in the switchback wisdom of Zhan Tianyou's 1909 Qinglongqiao zigzag line, this proposal designs the AI Innovation Belt as a track system whose direction is decided by humans at critical nodes: one rail (the heritage-park slow green spine), three switches (Zhongzhiyuan R&D switch · green, Origin Community talent switch · yellow, Dazhongsi market switch · red), and two wings (Zhongguancun tech-services wing, Xiaoyuehe scenario-empowerment wing), using a green/yellow/red three-state switch language to return the direction choice of the AI city to people.",
