    "titleEn": "Jingzhang Neural Spine: AI Rebirth of the Centennial Railway",
    "summary": "以京张铁路遗址公园9公里带状空间为主轴，提出'一带三核、双环十二景'的城市设计方案。融合百年铁路文化遗产与AI神经网络意象，构建全球首个AI原生城市创新带。方案覆盖43.6km²统筹研究范围与11.4km²总体设计范围，包含18个用地分区、106栋概念建筑、12张AI场景卡、3个AI朝圣地标、5类用户画像和完整的分期实施策略。本方案基于provisional边界生成，保留精度警示，待官方数据发布后统一复算。",
    "summaryEn": "Centered on the 9 km linear corridor of the Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park, this proposal presents an urban design scheme of 'one belt, three cores, two loops, and twelve scenic nodes' (Yi Dai San He, Shuang Huan Shi Er Jing). It merges the heritage of the centennial railway with the imagery of an AI neural network to build the world's first AI-native urban innovation belt. The scheme covers a 43.6 km² Coordinated Research Area and an 11.4 km² Overall Design Area, including 18 land-use zones, 106 conceptual buildings, 12 AI scenario cards, 3 AI pilgrimage landmarks, 5 user personas, and a complete phased implementation strategy. This proposal is generated on provisional boundaries, retains precision cautions, and will be fully recalculated when official data is published.",
