    "title": "京张AI原点回环：一条从原点出发、又回到原点的创新闭环",
    "titleEn": "京张AI原点回环：一条从原点出发、又回到原点的创新闭环 / JINGZHANG AI ORIGIN LOOP: An Innovation Loop That Leaves Its Origin and Returns",
    "summary": "以「京张AI原点回环」（JINGZHANG AI ORIGIN LOOP）为总体概念，把京张铁路的人字形折返、中关村的策源传统与AI时代的知识回流合成一条可持续闭环：一带（遗址公园活力带）一环（原点回环慢行绿环）三核（众智园·原点社区·大钟寺）两翼（中关村科技服务翼·小月河场景赋能翼），用12张场景卡、6类用户画像、3处AI朝圣地标与年度回环运营，让每一次创新都回到原点、沉淀为公共知识。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the JINGZHANG AI ORIGIN LOOP as the overarching concept, this proposal fuses the herringbone switchback of the Jingzhang Railway, Zhongguancun's tradition of innovation incubation, and the knowledge reflux of the AI era into one sustainable loop: one belt (the Heritage Park vitality belt), one loop (the Origin Loop slow-traffic green loop), three cores (Zhongzhiyuan · Origin Community · Dazhongsi), and two wings (Zhongguancun Technology Service Wing · Xiaoyue River Scenario Empowerment Wing). Through 12 scenario cards, 6 user personas, 3 AI pilgrimage landmarks, and annual loop operations, every innovation returns to its origin and settles into public knowledge.",
