    "title": "智脉京张：百年京张AI创新带概念性城市设计方案",
    "titleEn": "Zhimai Jing-Zhang: Conceptual Urban Design for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "以“智脉京张”为总体概念，把京张铁路“百年自主创新”精神转化为AI时代城市基础设施隐喻：沿京张遗址公园形成“一脉串三区、两翼展四极”的空间结构，以慢行绿廊串联众智园AI自主创新加速区、北京AI原点社区、大钟寺AI产业集聚区，以中关村科技服务翼与小月河场景赋能翼支撑五大功能，提出12张AI场景卡、4处AI朝圣地标和三阶段实施计划。所有空间落地建议均为概念建议、参考方案，可供专业团队深化研究。",
    "summaryEn": "Under the overall concept of 'Zhimai Jing-Zhang' (The Intelligent Vein), the proposal translates the century-old self-made innovation spirit of the Jing-Zhang Railway into an AI-era urban infrastructure metaphor: a spatial structure of 'one vein linking three areas, two wings unfolding four poles' along the Jing-Zhang Heritage Park, connecting the Zhongzhiyuan AI Acceleration Area, the Beijing AI Origin Community, and the Dazhongsi AI Industry Cluster through a slow-mobility green corridor, with the Zhongguancun Technology-Service Wing and the Xiaoyuehe Scenario-Empowerment Wing supporting five functions. The proposal presents 12 AI scenario cards, 4 AI pilgrimage landmarks, and a three-phase implementation plan. All spatial proposals are conceptual suggestions and reference schemes for professional teams to deepen.",
