    "summary": "以京张铁路遗产为公共主线，把众智园的研发验证、AI原点社区的成果转译、大钟寺的市场采用组织成完整价值链，并由中关村科技服务翼与小月河场景赋能翼提供跨区支撑。方案以可撤回、可复核、有人兜底的十二类场景，让全球AI创新与市民日常在同一条城市走廊相遇。",
    "summaryEn": "Using the Jing-Zhang railway heritage as a public spine, this proposal links research and validation at Zhongzhiyuan, translation of research outcomes at the Beijing AI Origin Community, and market adoption at Dazhongsi into a complete value chain. The Zhongguancun Technology Services Wing and Xiaoyue River Scenario Enablement Wing provide cross-district support. Twelve reversible, auditable, human-backed scenarios bring global AI innovation into everyday urban life.",
