    "id": "UncleJ-h/urbanos-studio",
    "slug": "urbanos-studio",
    "title": "京张实证带 · The Jingzhang Proving Belt",
    "titleEn": "The Jingzhang Proving Belt",
    "summary": "以「实证权」为核心机制的百年京张 AI 创新带方案：把「场景」制度化为土地/空间/产业/资金/人才/算力/数据之外的第八类可配置要素，三区（源证·共证·市证）承载实证发生，两翼（通证·践证）从布局陪衬升格为机制器官——「通证」在本方案中指实证权的受理与发放窗口职能，不涉及任何区块链或数字代币含义——四步闭环（授权→实证→兑现→反馈）把公众纳入实证权续期与收回的治理回路。全部空间与机制表述为概念建议，供专业团队深化研究。",
    "summaryEn": "A proposal for the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt built on one mechanism: the proving right. Scenario becomes an eighth configurable urban resource alongside land, space, industry, capital, talent, computing power and data. Three zones (Genesis, Commons, Market) host proving; two wings (Exchange, Practice) are promoted from layout accessories to institutional organs — 'Exchange' here denotes the intake and issuance window for proving rights, and carries no blockchain or digital-token meaning — and a four-step loop (authorise, prove, deliver, feed back) puts the public inside the governance circuit that renews or ends a proving right. All spatial and institutional statements are conceptual recommendations for professional teams to develop further.",
