    "summary": "以「微光织锦」为核心理念,以 AI 公共空间、智能原生新业态与京张朝圣地标为深做主线,在三处重点区域分别提出「清河创新界面」「近校成果转化街」「大钟寺智能经济街区」三套概念;通过百年京张文化带、都市 AI 生活体验带、AI 融合创新带三大定位,统筹 43.6 km² / 11.4 km² / 368.4 ha 三层范围,提出 6 类 AI 公共空间组件、10 张 AI 场景卡、5 类用户画像、3 处 AI 朝圣地标、6 个更新项目,并给出全球 AI 创新活动体系与长期运营机制。所有结论均以 provisional boundary 为起点,明确披露精度警示与复算要求,不替代正式规划与政府审定。",
    "summaryEn": "Lumina Trail weaves AI public space, intelligent-native new业态 and three AI pilgrimage landmarks through three key areas of the Centennial Jing-Zhang AI Innovation Belt — Qinghe Innovation Interface, Near-Campus成果转化 Street, and Dazhongsi Smart Economy Block. The proposal aligns with the official 43.6 km² / 11.4 km² / 368.4 ha three-scope framework, three positioning statements, five functions, and three-area-two-wing structure. It packages 6 AI public-space components, 10 scenario cards, 5 personas, 3 pilgrimage landmarks, 6 renewal projects, and a global AI event and long-term operation system. All claims are grounded in the provisional boundary and the public source registry, with explicit precision warnings and a recalculation commitment when official polygons replace the provisional geometry.",
