    "titleEn": "The Jing-Zhang Mileposts: From Mile Zero to a World-Class AI Innovation Belt",
    "summary": "以京张铁路真实的里程标为遗产线索，把「里程」转化为「里程碑」：9公里绿廊对应9个主题里程站（K0西直门门户—K8北五环），AI原点社区设零点里程碑（0.0km创新零点）；用物理、数字、文化三重里程标体系与铁路语汇状态机组织空间、场景、荣誉与运营，全部空间结论基于临时边界，供专业团队深化。",
    "summaryEn": "Taking the real mileposts of the Jing-Zhang Railway as a heritage clue, the proposal turns distance into milestones: nine themed mile stations (K0 Xizhimen gateway to K8 North Fifth Ring) mapped onto the 9-km green corridor, with a Zero Milepost (0.0 km innovation origin) in the AI Origin Community. A three-layer milepost system (physical, digital, cultural) and a railway-vocabulary state machine organize space, scenarios, honor, and operations; all spatial conclusions use provisional boundaries and await professional deepening.",
