    "titleEn": "THE GROUND-TRUTH CITY: A Signable Urban-State Infrastructure for Jing-Zhang",
    "summary": "以京张遗址公园为城市本象线，把众智园验证、AI原点社区公共解释、大钟寺日常采用组织成可追溯、可签署、可撤回的城市变更链；任何高影响提议，无论来自AI还是人，都必须以可核对事实为前提，并由依法有权且受影响的人共同签署。",
    "summaryEn": "Using the Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park as the Urban Ground-Truth Line, this proposal organizes Zhongzhiyuan AI Independent Innovation Acceleration Area verification, Beijing AI Origin Community public interpretation, and Dazhongsi AI Industry Cluster daily adoption into a traceable, signable, and reversible urban change chain; any high-impact proposal—whether from AI or humans—must be grounded in verifiable facts and jointly signed by legally authorized and affected parties.",
