    "title": "京张三叠：同一走廊的三次变奏——百年京张AI创新带城市设计",
    "titleEn": "The Jing-Zhang Variations: Three Variations on One Corridor",
    "summary": "一个可核验的场地事实：设计时速350公里的京张高铁，正从1909年老京张地表线（今遗址公园）脚下的清华园隧道穿过。由此读出『京张定律』：每次提速，都把速度藏得更深，把地面还得更慢。本方案让AI作为第三叠遵守同一条定律——算力入地、机器人入夜、屏幕退场，智能只在十二口『井』中露头，地面留给更安静的市井。",
    "summaryEn": "One verifiable site fact: the 350 km/h design-speed Jing-Zhang high-speed railway now runs through the Qinghuayuan Tunnel directly beneath the 1909 surface alignment that has become the Jing-Zhang Railway Heritage Park. From it we read the Jing-Zhang Law: every acceleration buries the speed deeper and gives the ground back slower. AI, as the third layer, obeys the same law — compute underground, robots at night, screens off the street; intelligence surfaces only at twelve wells, and the ground is left quieter.",
