    "summaryEn": "Built on Zhan Tianyou's switchback alignment as its organising concept and rooted in the people's city principle: the falling-left stroke is the completed 9 km Memory Line greenway, the falling-right stroke is the Intelligence Line overlaying computing power and scenarios, and the two switch back at the apex in the Beijing AI Origin Community; Zhongzhiyuan and Dazhongsi work as a double-heading pair. Through conceptual land-use zoning, 248 conceptual buildings, 12 AI scenario nodes and three pilgrimage landmarks, it sets out a brownfield AI innovation belt where a century switches back.",
