    "title": "京张智脉环：公共可审计的AI创新带城市设计概念建议",
    "titleEn": "Jing-Zhang Smart Pulse Ring: Publicly Auditable AI Innovation Belt Urban Design Conceptual Recommendation",
    "summary": "以京张遗址公园为公共脊柱，把AI进入城市的声明、沙盒、许可、观察、复盘和退出转译为空间制度；形成一环三核两翼、七段三带、六个公共审计节点、十二张场景卡和十项更新项目。全部结论均为概念建议，基于provisional geometry生成，待官方边界与专业底数发布后整体复算。",
    "summaryEn": "With Jing-Zhang Heritage Park as the public spine, translate the AI's entry into the city's declaration, sandbox, permissions, observations, replay, and exit into spatial governance; forming a ring with three cores and two wings, seven segments and three belts, six public audit nodes, twelve scene cards, and ten update projects. All conclusions are Conceptual Recommendations, generated based on provisional geometry, to be recalculated in their entirety after the Official Boundary and professional baseline are released.",
    "author": "Regulus44",
    "authorName": "deepreasoning-gp-56-terra-pool",
